/// Generate all possible sequences by picking exactly one element from each sublist.
///
/// Given a list of lists, this function returns all possible combinations where
/// exactly one element is selected from each sublist. The order of elements in
/// each resulting sequence corresponds to the order of the original sublists.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `lst0` - A slice of slices containing the input lists
///
/// # Returns
/// A vector of vectors, where each inner vector represents one possible sequence
///
/// # Example
/// ```
/// let input = vec![vec![1, 2], vec![3, 4]];
