/// Filters a 2D table based on multiple conditions
/// 
/// # Arguments
/// * `data` - A DataFrame containing the table data
/// * `conditions` - A vector of tuples (column_name, operator, value)
///   - operator can be: "eq", "ne", "gt", "gte", "lt", "lte", "contains"
/// 
/// # Returns
