/// Groups a DataFrame by a specified field, applies an aggregation function,
/// and returns the result as a 2D table (DataFrame) with the grouped values.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `df` - Input DataFrame containing the data to group
/// * `group_field` - Name of the field to group by
/// * `agg_function` - Aggregation function to apply (e.g., mean, sum, count)
/// * `agg_field` - Name of the field to aggregate
///
/// # Returns
/// A DataFrame where each row represents a unique value from `group_field`,
/// and the aggregated value is in a new column
///
/// # Example
/// ```
