# Rust Function for Counting Tuple Occurrences (2025+)

```rust
use std::collections::HashMap;

/// A modern Rust function to count tuple occurrences with advanced operations.
/// Uses Rust 1.75+ features and demonstrates contemporary patterns.
///
/// # Example
/// ```
