/// 
/// # Arguments
/// * `lst0` - A list of associative maps (HashMap<String, Value>) to be sorted
/// * `lst1` - A list of values that defines the desired order
/// * `var0` - The key in the associative maps whose value should match elements in lst1
/// 
/// # Returns
