/// Groups columns of a 2D table by their labels and computes the sum of values in each group.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `table` - A 2D table (DataFrame) where each column has a label and numeric values
/// * `group_by_column` - The name of the column to group by (must be a string column)
/// * `value_columns` - The names of columns whose values should be summed
///
/// # Returns
