///
/// # Arguments
/// * `lists` - A vector of vectors to be combined
/// * `sequence` - A vector specifying which list to draw from at each step (0-indexed)
///
/// # Returns
/// A single combined vector following the specified sequence
///
/// # Panics
/// Panics if a sequence index is out of bounds or if a list is exhausted before the sequence completes
///
/// # Example
/// ```
/// let lists = vec![
