/// Sorts the keys of a key-value mapping based on the sequence of letters and digits in each key.
/// 
/// The sorting algorithm:
/// 1. Extracts only letters (a-z, A-Z) and digits (0-9) from each key
/// 2. Compares the extracted sequences character by character
