/// Z-score normalize every numeric column of `df0`.
///
/// - Numeric columns (integers and floats) are converted to f64 z-scores:
///   z = (x - mean) / std, using the sample standard deviation (denominator n-1).
/// - Columns with no non-null values are left unchanged.
/// - Columns with zero standard deviation (constant columns) are set to 0.0 for all
